    "description": "This NCEI Accession includes Simulation and assimilation of global ocean pCO2 and air-sea CO2 fluxes using ship observations of surface ocean pCO2 in a simplified biogeochemical offline model from 1996-01-01 to 2004-12-31. These data were calculated by Vinu Valsala and Shamil Maksyutov of National Institute for Environmental Studies as part of the Gobal ocean pCO2 and air-sea CO2 fluxes data set. CDIAC associated the following cruise ID(s) with this data set: Gobal ocean pCO2 and air-sea CO2 fluxes.",
